Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ye hai aapka FLOWRA Dashboard — aapke business ka homepage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabse upar aapko chaar cards dikhenge: Total Sales Total Orders Outstanding Amount
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,aur Beat Coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeh charon numbers har 30 second mein automatic refresh hote hain — Tally ka latest data.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Aap manually bhi Refresh button daba sakte hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Neeche What's New panel hai jab bhi FLOWRA mein koi naya feature aata hai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,yaha update dikhega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Aur bhi neeche aapko upcoming reminders, overdue customer digest, aur sync status dikhega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Upar navigation bar mein Sales CRM Inventory Analytics Salesman AI Reports CA Corner
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,har tab ek alag feature ke liye hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Right side mein FY selector hai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,usko change karke aap kisi bhi financial year ka data dekh sakte hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple, na?
